1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:01,480
Humanity breathes out
全人类每年呼出

2
00:00:01,480 --> 00:00:03,950
two billion tons of carbon dioxide a year.
二十亿吨二氧化碳。

3
00:00:03,950 --> 00:00:05,480
That's a new global estimate
这是《柳叶刀·星球健康》

4
00:00:05,480 --> 00:00:07,300
in The Lancet Planetary Health.
刚发表的一项全球估算。

5
00:00:07,300 --> 00:00:10,630
In nineteen eighty five it was about one point two billion tons.
1985 年大约十二亿吨，

6
00:00:10,630 --> 00:00:12,830
Up seventy four percent in thirty years.
三十年涨了百分之七十四。

7
00:00:12,830 --> 00:00:13,680
Most of that rise
涨的六成多，

8
00:00:13,680 --> 00:00:15,730
is simply because there are more of us.
是因为人变多了。

9
00:00:15,730 --> 00:00:18,180
So today's brain teaser: every time you exhale,
今天的烧脑问题：你每呼一口气，

10
00:00:18,180 --> 00:00:19,700
are you heating the planet?
是不是都在给地球加热？

11
00:00:19,700 --> 00:00:20,690
Meet our hero, Puff:
认识主角：小呼，

12
00:00:20,690 --> 00:00:22,180
the breath you just let out.
你刚呼出的那一口气。

13
00:00:22,180 --> 00:00:24,300
Puff is about four percent carbon dioxide,
小呼里大约百分之四是二氧化碳，

14
00:00:24,300 --> 00:00:26,950
a hundred times more than the air you breathed in.
是吸进来的空气的一百倍。

15
00:00:26,950 --> 00:00:28,690
Where does that carbon come from?
这些碳从哪来？

16
00:00:28,690 --> 00:00:29,400
Your lunch.
你的午饭。

17
00:00:29,400 --> 00:00:31,420
Your cells burn food with oxygen,
细胞用氧气“烧”食物，

18
00:00:31,420 --> 00:00:33,680
like a very slow, very gentle fire.
像一堆很慢、很温柔的火。

19
00:00:33,680 --> 00:00:35,020
Out come energy, water,
烧出来的是能量、水，

20
00:00:35,020 --> 00:00:36,250
and carbon dioxide.
和二氧化碳。

21
00:00:36,250 --> 00:00:37,730
Twist one: when you lose fat,
反转一：你减掉的脂肪，

22
00:00:37,730 --> 00:00:38,720
where does it go?
去哪了？

23
00:00:38,720 --> 00:00:40,050
Mostly out of your mouth.
大部分从嘴里呼出去了。

24
00:00:40,050 --> 00:00:43,720
One study found about eighty four percent leaves as carbon dioxide.
一项研究算出约百分之八十四变成了二氧化碳。

25
00:00:43,720 --> 00:00:45,070
The rest leaves as water.
剩下的变成水。

26
00:00:45,070 --> 00:00:46,910
So yes, you breathe weight away.
所以减肥，真的是“呼”掉的。

27
00:00:46,910 --> 00:00:48,960
Our rough math: averaged over everyone,
我们粗算一下：平均每人每天

28
00:00:48,960 --> 00:00:52,080
that's about three quarters of a kilo per person per day.
呼出大约四分之三公斤。

29
00:00:52,080 --> 00:00:53,250
Twist two: that carbon
反转二：这些碳，

30
00:00:53,250 --> 00:00:55,170
was up in the sky just months ago.
几个月前还在天上。

31
00:00:55,170 --> 00:00:56,700
A plant grabbed it from the air
植物从空气里抓住它，

32
00:00:56,700 --> 00:00:59,340
and turned it into rice, bread, or grass for a cow.
变成米饭、面条，或者牛吃的草。

33
00:00:59,340 --> 00:00:59,900
You ate it,
你吃下去，

34
00:00:59,900 --> 00:01:01,460
and gave it back to the sky.
又把它还给了天空。

35
00:01:01,460 --> 00:01:02,010
It's a loop,
这是一个圈，

36
00:01:02,010 --> 00:01:04,320
like borrowing a pen and handing it right back.
就像借了支笔，马上又还回去。

37
00:01:04,320 --> 00:01:05,680
Fossil fuels are different:
化石燃料不一样：

38
00:01:05,680 --> 00:01:08,670
that carbon was locked underground for millions of years.
那些碳在地下锁了几百万年。

39
00:01:08,670 --> 00:01:10,340
Burning it is a one way trip:
烧了就是单程票：

40
00:01:10,340 --> 00:01:12,480
brand new carbon, added to the sky.
天上凭空多出新的碳。

41
00:01:12,480 --> 00:01:13,920
For scale: fossil fuels emit
比一比：化石燃料每年排放

42
00:01:13,920 --> 00:01:16,050
about thirty eight billion tons a year.
大约三百八十亿吨。

43
00:01:16,050 --> 00:01:17,450
That's roughly eighteen times
差不多是全人类呼吸的

44
00:01:17,450 --> 00:01:18,930
all of humanity's breathing.
十八倍。

45
00:01:18,930 --> 00:01:20,420
Twist three: the researchers say
反转三：研究者说，

46
00:01:20,420 --> 00:01:21,990
breath is still worth counting.
呼吸还是值得算一算。

47
00:01:21,990 --> 00:01:24,140
Not because breathing drives climate change.
不是因为呼吸在推动气候变化，

48
00:01:24,140 --> 00:01:25,880
They say plainly that it doesn't.
他们明说：不是。

49
00:01:25,880 --> 00:01:27,190
But because a carbon ledger
而是因为碳的账本，

50
00:01:27,190 --> 00:01:29,000
should track every flow in and out.
每一笔进出都该记清楚。

51
00:01:29,000 --> 00:01:30,150
Our own extra thought:
我们自己多想一步：

52
00:01:30,150 --> 00:01:33,570
growing, shipping and cooking food burns plenty of fossil fuel.
种粮、运粮、做饭，可是要烧不少化石燃料。

53
00:01:33,570 --> 00:01:35,000
And here's one you can see:
还有：一屋子人开会，

54
00:01:35,000 --> 00:01:38,370
pack a room with people, and the carbon dioxide meter climbs.
二氧化碳读数就一路往上爬。

55
00:01:38,370 --> 00:01:40,370
Breathing is photosynthesis in reverse:
呼吸其实是光合作用倒着放：

56
00:01:40,370 --> 00:01:44,280
plants pack carbon into sugar with sunlight, and you unpack it for energy.
植物用阳光把碳装进糖里，你把它拆开取能量。

57
00:01:44,280 --> 00:01:45,930
So every bit of energy you have
所以你身上的每一分力气，

58
00:01:45,930 --> 00:01:47,540
is really borrowed sunlight.
说到底都是借来的阳光。

59
00:01:47,540 --> 00:01:49,520
Cows, dogs and cats breathe out too.
牛、狗、猫也都在呼气，

60
00:01:49,520 --> 00:01:51,410
Same loop, same borrowed carbon.
同一个圈，同样是借来的碳。

61
00:01:51,410 --> 00:01:52,450
What tips the ledger
真正让账本失衡的，

62
00:01:52,450 --> 00:01:54,690
is the carbon we dig up from underground.
是从地下挖出来的那部分。

63
00:01:54,690 --> 00:01:56,650
The rising carbon dioxide in the sky
天上的二氧化碳越来越多，

64
00:01:56,650 --> 00:01:58,730
comes mainly from that one way trip.
主要就是这笔单程账。

65
00:01:58,730 --> 00:02:01,140
Fine print: two billion tons is an estimate,
友情提示：二十亿吨是估算，

66
00:02:01,140 --> 00:02:04,420
built from thousands of measurements plus population data.
靠的是几千次实测加上人口和体重数据。

67
00:02:04,420 --> 00:02:05,830
And more people breathing
而且，人多了在呼吸，

68
00:02:05,830 --> 00:02:07,300
is not a problem to fix.
可不是什么要“解决”的问题。

69
00:02:07,300 --> 00:02:09,160
So, is your breath heating the planet?
所以，你的呼吸在加热地球吗？

70
00:02:09,160 --> 00:02:11,230
Not really. It's carbon on a round trip.
基本不会。那是在转圈的碳。

71
00:02:11,230 --> 00:02:12,590
Puff says: I'm recycled.
小呼说：我是循环再用的。

72
00:02:12,590 --> 00:02:14,020
The tailpipe isn't.
排气管可不是。

